with structure/native-profile/ddfca406d839c3326d0987503fa76b61c6c924fad3c096b0650f13b535e1e57f/candidate as SignalSeedCandidate
with structure/native-profile/ddfca406d839c3326d0987503fa76b61c6c924fad3c096b0650f13b535e1e57f/result as NativeSignalSeed
